  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/02/IMG_4741.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El Frankfurt Gandia, en la calle Mos&eacute;n Mart&iacute;, 1 de Onda, ha acogido este viernes, en sesiones de tarde y noche, ambas muy concurridas, un concierto del nuevo grupo de flamenquito local Efecto Carajillo.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertefectocarajillofrankfurtgandia/img_4715.jpg\" alt=\"img_4715\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertefectocarajillofrankfurtgandia/img_4717.jpg\" alt=\"img_4717\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertefectocarajillofrankfurtgandia/img_4719.jpg\" alt=\"img_4719\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertefectocarajillofrankfurtgandia/img_4720.jpg\" alt=\"img_4720\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertefectocarajillofrankfurtgandia/img_4722.jpg\" alt=\"img_4722\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertefectocarajillofrankfurtgandia/img_4727.jpg\" alt=\"img_4727\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertefectocarajillofrankfurtgandia/img_4728.jpg\" alt=\"img_4728\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertefectocarajillofrankfurtgandia/img_4729.jpg\" alt=\"img_4729\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertefectocarajillofrankfurtgandia/img_4730.jpg\" alt=\"img_4730\" style=\"max